  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧與水利工程：大語言模型的應用",
    "sub_ename": "ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE AND HYDRAULIC ENGINEERING: APPLICATIONS OF LARGE LANGUAGE MODELS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程結合人工智慧與大語言模型(LLMs)應用於水利工程，培養學生運用新興技術解決水利工程問題的能力。課程涵蓋文獻閱讀、圖表製作與報告撰寫等基礎技能，並培訓時間序列分析、水文水理模擬與水資源管理的實務能力。不僅學習LLMs功能，並結合Office、Notion、Python、TensorFlow、HEC-RAS、SRH-2D等i工具教學。學生將透過專題研究、案例分析、模型協作與程式開發，學習如何運用 LLMs 解決水利工程問題並執行實務專案，提升水利專業與新興技術整合的應用能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course integrates artificial intelligence and large language models (LLMs) into hydraulic engineering applications, equipping students with the ability to leverage emerging technologies to solve hydraulic engineering issues. The curriculum covers fundamental skills such as literature review, chart creation, technical report writing, and practical training in time series analysis, hydrological and hydraulic simulations, and water resource management. In addition to learning the applications of LLMs in hydraulic engineering, students will receive instruction on relevant tools, including Office, Notion, Python, TensorFlow, HEC-RAS, and SRH-2D. Through project-based research, case studies, model collaboration, and programming development, students will gain the expertise to apply LLMs in solving field site problems and executing practical projects, enhancing their ability to integrate hydraulic engineering with emerging technologies.",
